:: StoryData
{
  "start": "Start"
}

:: StoryInit
/* ------------------------------------------------------------------
   A tiny sample story that uses every Darkroom feature once.
   Replace it with your own. Each passage starts with  :: Name
   Lines starting with @ are directives (pictures, sound, logic).
   Every other line is a line of text: one click each.
   ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
@set $trust = 0
@set $hasLetter = false

:: Start {"position":"100,100"}
@card "Chapter One" "The harbor at night"
@bg harbor move=in time=40
@ambience rain volume=0.5
@music theme fade=4
Rain on the black water. The ferry stopped running years ago.
Somewhere behind you, a door bangs in the wind.
@sfx door
Stranger: You came back.
Mara: Don't listen to him. Walk with me.
@include Harbor choices

:: Harbor choices [widget] {"position":"300,100"}
[[Walk with Mara->Alley][$trust += 1]]
[[Answer the stranger->Stranger]]
@if not $hasLetter
[[Read the letter in your pocket->Letter]]
@endif

:: Letter {"position":"300,250"}
@image letter pos=middle fade=0.8
The envelope is soft from the rain. The handwriting is yours, from a year you don't remember.
*Meet me on the roof. You'll know why.*
@set $hasLetter = true
@image clear
@include Harbor choices

:: Stranger {"position":"500,250"}
@fx flash
Stranger: Everyone comes back. The city keeps what it's owed.
When you look again, there is nobody there.
@set $trust -= 1
[[Find Mara->Alley]]

:: Alley {"position":"500,100"}
@bg alley fade=2 move=left time=30
@stop ambience fade=3
@if $trust > 0
Mara: I knew you'd pick me.
@elseif visited("Stranger")
Mara: You talked to him. Everyone talks to him once.
@else
Mara: You took your time.
@endif
@if $hasLetter
Mara: You read it, didn't you? Then you know where we're going.
@endif
A tram passes at the end of the street, lit up and empty.
@video intro
[[Climb to the roof->Rooftop]]
[[Go home->Home]]

:: Rooftop {"position":"700,50"}
@bg rooftop fade=3
@music stop fade=5
@wait 1.5
From up here the city is all black glass and white rain.
@if $trust >= 1 and $hasLetter
Mara: Now you remember.
@ending remember "The Night You Remembered"
@else
Mara: Maybe next time.
@ending forget "The City Keeps You"
@endif

:: Home {"position":"700,200"}
@fx fadeout time=3
You walk home. You don't look back.
@ending home "Home Before Morning"
